    "q-86034": {
      "dom_id": "step-q86034",
      "name": "Question 15",
      "problem": "If $[a]_{n}$ denotes the residue class containing all integers congruent to $a$ modulo $n,$ then $[-21]_{6}=$",
      "worked_solution": "We have $[a]_{6}=[b]_{6}$ if \n\n$$\na≡b\\,(\\text{mod}\\,6).\n$$\n\nThe residue class $[-21]_{6}$ consists of the elements that are congruent to $-21$ modulo $6.$ \n\nWe can find an alternative representation for this residue class as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[-21]_{6} & ={x\\in Z\\,|\\,x≡-21\\,(\\text{mod}\\,6)} \\\\  & ={x\\in Z\\,|\\,x≡(-4)\\cdot 6+3\\,(\\text{mod}\\,6)} \\\\  & ={x\\in Z\\,|\\,x≡(-4)\\cdot 0+3\\,(\\text{mod}\\,6)} \\\\  & ={x\\in Z\\,|\\,x≡3\\,(\\text{mod}\\,6)} \\\\  & =[3]_{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-86034-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "[5]_{6}",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"210\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mn>6</mn></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-86034-b",
